From 63014c2f55328b72a9400ac4b01bb84f4aa61b07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CrownPrime <228779844+CrownPrime@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:15:44 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] CrownsDLSS5ER branding for the in-game menu

Adds a CrownsDLSS5ER header with the CrownPrime emblem drawn as ImGui shapes,
prefixes the main window title, and switches the dark theme to warm black,
cream text and dark-gold borders. The DLSS-NR model node, timing bar and
running indicator use gold instead of green. Settings and behaviour are
unchanged. Based on f45ccf3a (the v0.8.91 build).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
