 OptiScaler/dlssnr/DlssNr_PipelineUi.h |  4 +-
 OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp       | 95 ++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 89 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

